        "original_id": "807016b1-3c75-58b2-b7ce-05a0b93aea28",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Timothy Björklund, Debra Jo Rupp\n- Works: Teacher's Pet, Big\n- Awards: Golden Satellite Award\n- Topics: animated films, television series adaptations, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Debra Jo Rupp played the timid secretary Miss Patterson in the film Big.\n- In 2004, Teacher's Pet was released as an American animated musical comedy film based on the television series of the same name, and the film concluded the series' central storyline.\n- Debra Jo Rupp voiced Mary Helperman in the animated series Teacher's Pet and in its sequel film.\n- In 2005, Teacher's Pet, which was Timothy Björklund's only film to date, was nominated for a Golden Satellite Award.",
